---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>SVG animation in an img</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Each ring should draw itself in one second, then "OK" fades in.</p>
    <figure>
      <img src="/ring.svg" width="200" height="200" alt="A ring that draws itself" />
      <figcaption>Eager</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <img src="/ring.svg?lazy" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" alt="A ring that draws itself" />
      <figcaption><code>loading="lazy"</code></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </body>
</html>
